# ACT 1 · Bus still · POI: bus driver. Reading his thoughts, then the option to fast-forward to school (Act 2).
BusDriver: [i]Six stops to the school. Light at Fourth is always red. Always.[/i]
BusDriver: [i]Same faces every morning. Same girl in the back, talking to her phone like it's talking back.[/i]
